Recovery
├── requires RECOVERY_ROLE and an active reconciled position
├── snapshots only outstanding liabilities after earlier normal withdrawals
├── pauses normal deposits, claims, and redemptions
├── transfers exactly the tracked st-yBOLD balance to recovery treasury
├── accepts settlement ETH only from the configured treasury
├── activates once with sufficient funding and a non-zero uniform rate
├── reverts without accounting changes if committed ETH becomes unavailable
├── settles full or partial-loss claims through the existing YieldManager
├── keeps large and unequal claims pro-rata regardless of payout order
├── caps an oversized final claim at remaining principal
├── prevents repeated transitions and repeated settlement
└── sweeps only surplus ETH after every principal claim is settled
